,0 L1440,100 L0,100 Z\" class=\"wave-green\"\/>\n                <path d=\"M0,40 C200,85 400,15 600,40 C800,65 1000,10 1200,40 C1320,58 1380,25 1440,40 L1440,100 L0,100 Z\" class=\"wave-white\"\/>\n            <\/svg>\n        <\/div>\n<section class=\"newsletter-section-new\" id=\"newsletter\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"newsletter-card-new\">\n<div class=\"newsletter-right\">\n<h2 class=\"newsletter-title-new\">\u0627\u0646\u0636\u0645 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u062c\u062a\u0645\u0639\u0646\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u062d\u064a<\/h2>\n<p class=\"newsletter-text-new\">\u0646\u0635\u0627\u0626\u062d \u062a\u063a\u0630\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u062d\u0635\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0634\u0631\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0628\u0631\u064a\u062f\u0643\u060c \u0645\u0644\u062e\u0635 \u0623\u0647\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062f\u0648\u064a\u0646\u0627\u062a\u060c \u0648\u062e\u0635\u0648\u0645\u0627\u062a \u062e\u0627\u0635\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0634\u062a\u0631\u0643\u064a\u0646 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0645\u062c \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062f\u0631\u064a\u0628\u064a\u0629.<\/p>\n<div class=\"newsletter-perks\">\n<div class=\"perk\">\n                                <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"\/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"\/><\/svg><br \/>\n                                <span>\u0646\u0635\u0627\u0626\u062d \u0623\u0633\u0628\u0648\u0639\u064a\u0629 \u0639\u0645\u0644\u064a\u0629<\/span>\n                            <\/div>\n<div class=\"perk\">\n                                <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"\/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"\/><\/svg><br \/>\n                                <span>\u062e\u0635\u0648\u0645\u0627\u062a \u062d\u0635\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0634\u062a\u0631\u0643\u064a\u0646<\/span>\n                            <\/div>\n<div class=\"perk\">\n                                <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"\/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"\/><\/svg><br \/>\n                                <span>\u0645\u0644\u062e\u0635 \u0623\u0647\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0642\u0627\u0644\u0627\u062a<\/span>\n                            <\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"newsletter-left\">\n<form class=\"newsletter-form-new\" id=\"newsletterForm\">\n<div class=\"form-row\">\n<div class=\"form-group-new\">\n                                    <label for=\"nl-first\">\u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644<\/label><br \/>\n                                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"nl-first\" name=\"firstName\" placeholder=\"\u0623\u062f\u062e\u0644 \u0627\u0633\u0645\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644\" required>\n                                <\/div>\n<div class=\"form-group-new\">\n                                    <label for=\"nl-last\">\u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062e\u064a\u0631 <span class=\"optional\">(\u0627\u062e\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0631\u064a)<\/span><\/label><br \/>\n                                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"nl-last\" name=\"lastName\" placeholder=\"\u0623\u062f\u062e\u0644 \u0627\u0633\u0645\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062e\u064a\u0631\">\n                                <\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"form-group-new\">\n                                <label for=\"nl-email\">\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0628\u0631\u064a\u062f\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0644\u0643\u062a\u0631\u0648\u0646\u064a <span class=\"required\">*<\/span><\/label><br \/>\n                                <input type=\"email\" id=\"nl-email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"example@email.com\" required>\n                            <\/div>\n<p